begemphphrase italic 46
endemphphrase italic after 46

begemphphrase bold 46
endemphphrase bold after 46

begemphphrase underline 46
endemphphrase underline after 46

capsletter 6
begcapsword 456
endcapsword 56
multind 56-6 letsign capsletter
