word enough- 26-1256-126-36     needed for a test file
nofor lowword enough 26
always enough 26-1256-126

# his
match %[^_]|%[^_~]%<*[([{] his %[^_]|[)}\]]%>*%[^_~] 236
nofor lowword his 236

# in
