# Spanish Braille for Greek Text
#
# This braille code covers writing of Greek characters inside texts in
# Spanish, and also writing of complete Greek texts for users of the
# Spanish braille code, commonly used for Ancient Greek texts.

# Based on technical document B12-1 by the Comisión Braille Española
# (Spanish Braille Commission)
# <https://www.once.es/servicios-sociales/braille/documentos-tecnicos/documentos-tecnicos-relacionados-con-el-braille/documentos/b12-1-texto-griego-y-su-escritura-en-braille.pdf/download>
