# Mark Latin uppercase letters with dot 7 in computer braille
# mode. Should be used in combination with latinLetterDef6Dots.uti.

comp6 A 17
comp6 B 127
comp6 C 147
comp6 D 1457
comp6 E 157
comp6 F 1247
comp6 G 12457
comp6 H 1257
comp6 I 247
comp6 J 2457
comp6 K 137
comp6 L 1237
comp6 M 1347
comp6 N 13457
comp6 O 1357
comp6 P 12347
comp6 Q 123457
comp6 R 12357
comp6 S 2347
comp6 T 23457
comp6 U 1367
comp6 V 12367
comp6 W 24567
comp6 X 13467
comp6 Y 134567
comp6 Z 13567

# Back-translate uppercase letters in computer braille mode.

