# liblouis: Lithuanian 6-dot Braille table
#
# Copyright (C) 2017, 2025 Rimas Kudelis <rimas@kudelis.lt>
# Copyright (C) 2017, 2025 Tadas Matusevičius <tadas.matus@gmail.com>
