#   Unicode:  Mathematical Operators

sign \x2200 45-1 ∀   for all
sign \x2202 4-145 ∂   partial derivative
sign \x2203 45-15 ∃   there exists
sign \x2204 45-15-4 ∄   there does not exist
sign \x2205 4-245 ∅   empty set
