# liblouis: Chinese Common Braille Scheme
#
#-index-name: Mandarin, mainland China, common braille scheme
#-display-name: Chinese common braille, for simplified Chinese characters
#
#+language:cmn-Hans
#+region:cmn-CN
#+type:literary
#+system:cmn-traditional
#+variant:chinese-common-braille-scheme
#+direction:forward
#
# Version 2022-08-05
# The first version of the manual proofreading.
# This table contains 7093 Chinese characters.
# Most of the work on this table is done by Frank.
# The work of translating Chinese characters to ASCII Braille is done by Cary-rowen.
#
# Copyright (C) 2022 Frank <qkl200904@tom.com>
# Copyright (C) 2022 Cary-rowen <manchen_0528@outlook.com>
